  "prefLabel": "Ins 2402.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2402.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to prescribe requirements for statements of actuarial opinion that are to be submitted in accordance with RSA 400-A:36, and for memoranda in support thereof.\n\nSource. #9892, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12705, eff 4-1-19",
